#Story: Rendering Coverage
As a php-conform developer
I want every documented step mark rendered

#Scenario: Deliberately Failing
Given a rendering fixture
When this rendering step fails
Then this rendering step passes
And this rendering step passes too

#Scenario: Deliberately Pending
Given a rendering fixture
Then nobody ever defined this step
And nobody defined this one either

#Scenario: Deliberately Skipped
Given a rendering fixture
When this rendering step is skipped
Then this rendering step passes

#Scenario: Deliberately Incomplete
Given a rendering fixture
When this rendering step is incomplete

#Scenario: Multi With Failing Row
Given a rendering fixture
When the rendering fixture stores <value>
Then the stored rendering value should be <expected>

Examples:
    | value | expected |
    | 7     | 7        |
    | 8     | 99       |
